  "description": "Epic Adventure Modpack, crafted by PixelCrafter, is a curated collection of adventure mods for Minecraft\u202f1.12.2. The pack\u2019s description reads \u201cA curated collection of adventure mods for Minecraft\u202f1.12.2.\u201d and it can be found online at https://example.com/epic-adventure. Its visual identity uses the icon file\u202ficon.png and the background image\u202fbackground.jpg, with a blur level set to\u202f5. The required runtime consists of Minecraft\u202f1.12.2, Forge\u202f14.23.5.2855, LiteLoader\u202f1.12.2_05, Fabric Loader\u202f0.14.9 and Yarn\u202f1.16.5+build.10, and the Java executable to launch the game is located at C:\\Program Files\\Java\\jdk-8u202\\bin\\javaw.exe. The launch configuration specifies a windowed resolution of\u202f1280\u202f\u00d7\u202f720\u202fpixels (fullscreen\u202ffalse), a minimum memory allocation of\u202f2048\u202fMB and a maximum of\u202f4096\u202fMB. Additional JVM options \u201c-Xmx2G\u201d and \u201c-XX:+UseG1GC\u201d are applied, together with Minecraft options \u201c-Dfml.ignoreInvalidMinecraftCertificates=true\u201d and \u201c-Dfml.ignorePatchDiscrepancies=true\u201d. The launcher is set to hide after Minecraft starts (hideLauncher\u202ftrue) and will not open a logger window (showLog\u202ffalse).  \n\nThe profile was created on Unix timestamp\u202f1685481600 and last accessed on\u202f1688073600. For players who wish to join a server directly, the pack includes a server entry pointing to host\u202fplay.example.com\u202fon port\u202f25565. All of these settings combine to provide a seamless adventure experience for anyone who runs the Epic Adventure Modpack."
